        "created_at": "2013-01-04T19:12:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Wait. Did you win with just two heroes?! That's fantastic!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>No, the subheading that says \"the victory\" is referring to Baron blade's victory <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>i'll reword that subheading for people just reading the headings so as to not be misleading.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>But I do want to point out that Blade was down to about 3 hit points at the end! it was SO close. I blame it on the environment keeping us from drawing cards or using powers, for a good fifth of the game… <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=12\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
