        "raw": "[quote=\"arenson9\"]\n\nWait. Did you win with just two heroes?! That&#39;s fantastic!\n\n[/quote]\n\nNo, the subheading that says &quot;the victory&quot; is referring to Baron blade&#39;s victory :)\n\ni&#39;ll reword that subheading for people just reading the headings so as to not be misleading.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nBut I do want to point out that Blade was down to about 3 hit points at the end! it was SO close. I blame it on the environment keeping us from drawing cards or using powers, for a good fifth of the game... :(\n",
